{
  "bookId": "hero-213203",
  "id": "bond-28524",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|103|＝按玩家性别变化的敬称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28524001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "十二根睫毛，二十三根，四十七根……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "已经无聊到这个样子了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "所以「猜点数」的游戏，你也终于肯考虑了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "比起「输给你」，像财宝一样被盯着更难受，开始吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "1-10之间，选择一个喜欢的数字。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这次打算用多少秒猜到它。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "不，我们要来点新花样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "首先，用这个数字「乘以2」，接着，用得到的结果「加4」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "感谢怪盗小姐，一堂难忘的儿童数学。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "别心急，现在轮到除法了，小朋友，乖乖「除以2」吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那我可要当第一名，乘除加之后……还剩减法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "记得最初选择的数字吗？「减去它」以后，魔法就诞生了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么，就跟往常一样，请——猜——吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "答案是「2」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不论最初选择的是什么，经过运算，结果都会是2。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "积极抢答的学生，老师会不会更喜欢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "调皮的|103|，我想你还没弄清楚。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "就像不确定的1-10，始终走向2一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "浪漫的精髓在于它充满种种可能。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "但最终那些「可能」，都指向我跟你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "啊……中计了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "除此之外，上眼睑的睫毛数量，147根。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28524023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "学会了吗？怪盗只负责教授浪漫。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
